1
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:22,170
Sister, you frightened our guest.

2
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,680
I am Zhao Han.

3
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:37,840
May I ask,

4
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:41,740
are you Daoist Situ, who robbed the birthday gifts in the past?

5
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,160
Greetings, Lady Zhao.

6
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,860
Regarding what you just said,

7
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,520
how did you know?

8
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:52,840
I usually like to go to the teahouse to listen to storytelling.

9
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,440
Daoist,

10
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,080
I have heard the part about robbing the birthday gifts

11
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,560
dozens of times.

12
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,850
They all said you were enlightened by an immortal

13
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,560
and left with a heavenly eye.

14
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:03,680
This heavenly eye turned into a mole

15
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,250
between your eyebrows.

16
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,160
Based only on this,

17
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:11,700
don't you think it's a bit arbitrary, Lady Zhao?

18
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,160
Meeting for the first time,

19
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,760
it's inevitably arbitrary.

20
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:19,800
Brother Meng has also roughly explained your intentions.

21
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,480
Why don't we sit down and talk?

22
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,320
The distinguished guest's visit is a secret,

23
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,240
so we deliberately dismissed the servants in the mansion.

24
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,040
If our hospitality is lacking,

25
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,100
please forgive us.

26
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,360
We are the ones being presumptuous.

27
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,079
Seeing your face for the first time, lady,

28
00:02:52,079 --> 00:02:54,079
have you been unwell for a long time?

29
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,280
It's all right.

30
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,920
I will

31
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,180
take your pulse later.

32
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,880
It's fine.

33
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,320
I heard from Brother Meng

34
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,600
that you came to visit

35
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:12,520
because you intend to climb the West Tower of Fanlou on the night of the Lantern Festival.

36
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,720
May I know the reason?

37
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,840
Then may I ask you, Lady Zhao,

38
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,360
why are you willing to see us?

39
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,680
I listened to storytelling in the teahouse,

40
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,079
and not only did I hear of your heroic deeds,

41
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,060
but I also heard

42
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,280
about the various heroes and soldiers of Liangshan.

43
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,010
Why gather together and rebel?

44
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:33,880
I sigh for the fate of the Liangshan heroes,

45
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,760
and I look up to their great loyalty

46
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,280
and lofty aspirations.

47
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,240
However,

48
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,040
I still have some doubts in my heart,

49
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,000
and I hope you can clear them up for me.

50
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,930
Lady Zhao, please speak your mind.

51
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,360
Do you mean,

52
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,520
by entering the capital this time

53
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:53,079
and intending to ascend the Fan Restaurant on the Lantern Festival,

54
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:55,079
you want to assassinate His Majesty

55
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,420
and destroy the Zhao Song Empire?

56
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:00,120
Lady Zhao,

57
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,740
why would you say that?

58
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,360
Even though our Liangshan heroes

59
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,520
have been oppressed everywhere these past few years,

60
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,040
but

61
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,560
our loyal hearts have never changed.

62
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,040
Otherwise, why would we

63
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:15,360
travel a thousand miles to the capital

64
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,800
to protect His Majesty

65
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,200
on the Lantern Festival?

66
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,079
So you're not here to assassinate,

67
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:21,240
but to surrender?

68
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,320
Yes.

69
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,520
No,

70
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,000
not entirely.

71
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,450
What do you mean?

72
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,080
To tell you the truth,

73
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,920
our Liangshan heroes' spies in the south

74
00:04:35,159 --> 00:04:36,360
received news that

75
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:40,320
Fang La's gang intends to enter the capital and assassinate His Majesty.

76
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,040
That's why

77
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:44,040
we wanted to enter the capital to save him.

78
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:47,159
We want to make up for our past mistakes

79
00:04:47,159 --> 00:04:48,890
and return to the Song Dynasty.

80
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,420
So that's how it is.

81
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,720
However,

82
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,800
climbing Fanlou on the night of the Lantern Festival is no easy task.

83
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,250
Even with a living map and the defense map,

84
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:01,650
we can't guarantee absolute success.

85
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,820
Then what does Lady Zhao suggest?

86
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,930
If you want to meet His Majesty,

87
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,520
you must be recommended by his trusted aides

88
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:10,450
or high-ranking court officials.

89
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,300
Otherwise,

90
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:14,120
you will definitely be killed as an assassin.

91
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,120
Then, Lady Zhao,

92
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,160
do you have any strategy?

93
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,280
I have a close friend in the court.

94
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,160
Just like Instructor Lin,

95
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:24,840
she is also highly appreciated by His Majesty for her intelligence.

96
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,770
She is the Director of Bingjingwu,

97
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,400
responsible for the safety of His Majesty

98
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,400
and the safety of the Imperial City.

99
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,280
She is also the first to be personally appointed by His Majesty,

100
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:36,610
making her the first female high official of the Great Song.

101
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:43,600
I pay my respects to Director Chu.

102
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,560
You truly have the heavenly eye, Master.

103
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,560
This is

104
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,159
the Director of the Bingjing Office,

105
00:05:51,159 --> 00:05:52,040
Official Chu,

106
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,880
Chu Sanniang.

107
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,160
If Liangshan truly intends to surrender,

108
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,160
it would be a blessing for the court.

109
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,290
Though I am currently in distress,

110
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,800
I am still willing to lend you

111
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,760
a helping hand.

112
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,780
Please rest assured, Commander Chu.

113
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:17,520
We

114
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,360
will definitely help Commander Chu

115
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,720
clear your name.

116
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,080
Everyone.

117
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:31,960
Right now, they are searching for assassins everywhere outside.

118
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:34,080
As the Emperor considers the Zhao family loyal,

119
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,000
the Imperial City Department

120
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,800
won't dare to act rashly for now.

121
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:37,840
You might as well

122
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,500
stay in the residence for now.

123
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,650
Since time is tight,

124
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,400
it will also be convenient to discuss and act.

125
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,960
But what about your safety, sister?

126
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,159
Don't worry, sister.

127
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,800
I believe

128
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,920
even if something happens to the Zhao family,

129
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,920
you heroes

130
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,760
won't hurt me.

131
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,360
Besides.

132
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,400
Sister.

133
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,400
If you really went out with them,

134
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,130
I would be worried instead.

135
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,000
You wouldn't want me

136
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,920
dragging this sick body around

137
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,540
to look for you, would you?

138
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,540
Gentlemen.

139
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:07,050
Since you have entered the Zhao Manor,

140
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,440
please help

141
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,480
keep the Zhao Manor safe.

142
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,700
Rest assured, Commander Chu.

143
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:15,360
We will

144
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,720
do our best.

145
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,720
Uncle.

146
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,570
Sister-in-law.

147
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:29,930
Why are you here?

148
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,290
How is Xiaolian?

149
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,880
Xiaolian has been sleeping for the past two days.

150
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,480
But

151
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,540
she should be fine.

152
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,960
I don't know what to do.

153
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,540
Don't worry, Sister-in-law.

154
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,120
After today,

155
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,900
Xiaolian will wake up.

156
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,280
Really?

157
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,520
Lady Zhao.

158
00:07:58,159 --> 00:08:00,360
Thank you for taking care of my sister-in-law and sister.

159
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,760
You're too polite, Meng.

160
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:06,120
For Xiaolian to have a brother like you,

161
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,040
I am truly envious.

162
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,280
I...

163
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,640
Don't mind me, Meng.

164
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,000
It is only natural for a brother

165
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,780
to protect his sister.

166
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,480
I was being petty.

167
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:20,980
I am truly ashamed.

168
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:24,560
You must have a lot to talk about

169
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,620
with your sister-in-law and sister.

170
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,960
I'll leave you to it.

171
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,520
I'll walk you out.

172
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,640
Please stay, Meng.

173
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:45,330
Sister-in-law.

174
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,520
Uncle.

175
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,800
You...

176
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,690
What is this?

177
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,490
Where did you get so much money?

178
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,000
Uncle, tell me the truth.

179
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:58,200
Is this money for risking your life?

180
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,320
Of course not.

181
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,480
I just helped the officers with directions

182
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,360
and they rewarded me for it.

183
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,450
You're not lying to me, are you?

184
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:10,600
Please don't do anything foolish for me and Xiaolian.

185
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,460
I'm telling the truth.

186
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:13,880
I didn't risk my life.

187
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,760
You know,

188
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,640
I value my life.

189
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,410
I wouldn't want to leave you and my sister.

190
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,290
Sister-in-law,

191
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,400
here.

192
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,080
Keep this medicine safe.

193
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,040
It's life-saving medicine for Xiaolian.

194
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,370
Life-saving medicine?

195
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,010
Don't let anyone else know.

196
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:32,680
Not even Madam Zhao.

197
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,440
Understood?

198
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,240
Why?

199
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,880
I see that Lady Zhao's illness

200
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,880
is somewhat similar to Xiaolian's.

201
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,930
I'm worried it will cause trouble.

202
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,400
Lady Zhao.

203
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,000
Your pulse is quite stable.

204
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,760
It is nothing serious.

205
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:00,160
As long as you rest well

206
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,560
and take my elixir,

207
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,920
soon,

208
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,160
you will recover.

209
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:06,940
Taoist Priest,

210
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,460
please speak frankly.

211
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,480
Then I

212
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,740
won't hide it from you.

213
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,520
With your current physical condition,

214
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,380
even if you use our sect's elixir,

215
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,280
I'm afraid you won't be able to recover.
